<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Froilyn Joy L. Mintal | Portfolio</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <nav class="navbar">

            <a href="#home" class="logo">
                <span>&lt;/&gt;</span> MyPortfolio
            </a>

            <ul class="nav-links">
                <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
                <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
                <li><a href="#skills">Skills</a></li>
            </ul>

        </nav>
    </header>


    <main>

        <section id="home" class="hero">

            <div class="circle circle-one"></div>
            <div class="circle circle-two"></div>

            <div class="hero-content">

                <p class="welcome">
                    Welcome to my portfolio
                </p>

                <h1>
                    Hi, I'm
                    <span>Froilyn Joy L. Mintal</span>
                </h1>

                <h2>
                    Computer Science Student
                </h2>

                <p class="intro">
                    I am passionate about programming, web development,
                    and technology. I enjoy turning ideas into creative
                    and useful digital experiences.
                </p>

                <p class="tagline">
                    "Learn. Create. Innovate."
                </p>

                <div class="buttons">

                    <a href="#about" class="btn primary-btn">
                        Learn More →
                    </a>

                    <a href="#skills" class="btn secondary-btn">
                        View My Skills
                    </a>

                </div>

                <div class="social-links">

                    <a href="#" title="GitHub">GitHub</a>

                    <a href="#" title="Facebook">Facebook</a>

                    <a href="#" title="Email">Email</a>

                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="profile-container">

                <div class="profile-glow"></div>

                <div class="profile-card">

                    <img
                        src="formalpic.png"
                        alt="Profile photo of Froilyn Joy L. Mintal"
                    >

                    <div class="profile-label">

                        <span class="status-dot"></span>

                        Available for learning

                    </div>

                </div>

                <div class="floating-card card-one">
                    💻 Coding
                </div>

                <div class="floating-card card-two">
                    🚀 Creating
                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


        <section id="about" class="about">

            <div class="about-container">

                <div class="section-heading">

                    <p class="section-label">
                        GET TO KNOW ME
                    </p>

                    <h2>
                        About <span>Me</span>
                    </h2>

                    <p class="section-description">
                        A little more about who I am, what I enjoy,
                        and my journey as a Computer Science student.
                    </p>

                </div>


                <div class="about-content">


                    <div class="about-text">

                        <div class="about-card">

                            <div class="card-icon">
                                👋
                            </div>

                            <div>

                                <h3>
                                    Who I Am
                                </h3>

                                <p>
                                    I am Froilyn Joy L. Mintal, a
                                    Computer Science student who is
                                    interested in programming, web
                                    development, and technology.
                                </p>

                                <p>
                                    I enjoy learning new concepts
                                    and applying them through projects.
                                    I believe that every project is an
                                    opportunity to improve my skills,
                                    explore new ideas, and become a
                                    better developer.
                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                        <div class="about-card">

                            <div class="card-icon">
                                🎓
                            </div>

                            <div>

                                <h3>
                                    My Background
                                </h3>

                                <p>
                                    My studies in Computer Science
                                    have introduced me to programming,
                                    web development, software development,
                                    and different areas of technology.
                                </p>

                                <p>
                                    Through school activities and personal
                                    projects, I continue to practice my
                                    technical skills while learning how
                                    technology can be used to solve
                                    real-world problems.
                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                    <div class="hobbies-section">

                        <h3>
                            Things I Enjoy
                        </h3>

                        <p>
                            Outside of studying, these are some of the
                            things I enjoy doing in my free time.
                        </p>


                        <div class="hobbies-grid">

                            <div class="hobby-card">

                                <div class="hobby-icon">
                                    💻
                                </div>

                                <h4>
                                    Coding
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    Building projects and practicing
                                    programming.
                                </p>

                            </div>


                            <div class="hobby-card">

                                <div class="hobby-icon">
                                    🎮
                                </div>

                                <h4>
                                    Gaming
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    Playing games and exploring
                                    interactive experiences.
                                </p>

                            </div>


                            <div class="hobby-card">

                                <div class="hobby-icon">
                                    🎬
                                </div>

                                <h4>
                                    Movies
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    Watching movies and discovering
                                    new stories.
                                </p>

                            </div>


                            <div class="hobby-card">

                                <div class="hobby-icon">
                                    🏀
                                </div>

                                <h4>
                                    Sports
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    Trying and enjoying to play 
                                    various sports.
                                </p>

                            </div>

                        </div>

                    </div>

                </div>

            </div>

        </section>


<section id="skills" class="skills">

    <div class="skills-container">

        <div class="section-heading">

            <p class="section-label">
                WHAT I CAN DO
            </p>

            <h2>
                My <span>Skills</span>
            </h2>

            <p class="section-description">
                Here are some of the technical skills I have been
                developing through my studies, projects, and practice.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="skills-grid">


            <div class="skill-card">

                <div class="skill-icon">
                    &lt;/&gt;
                </div>

                <div class="skill-info">

                    <h3>
                        HTML
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Creating structured and semantic
                        web pages.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="skill-number">
                    01
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="skill-card">

                <div class="skill-icon">
                    🎨
                </div>

                <div class="skill-info">

                    <h3>
                        CSS
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Designing responsive and
                        interactive interfaces.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="skill-number">
                    02
                </div>

            </div>

            <div class="skill-card">

                <div class="skill-icon">
                    JS
                </div>

                <div class="skill-info">

                    <h3>
                        JavaScript
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Adding functionality and
                        interaction to websites.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="skill-number">
                    03
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="skill-card">

                <div class="skill-icon">
                    🐍
                </div>

                <div class="skill-info">

                    <h3>
                        Python
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Practicing programming concepts,
                        logic, and problem solving.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="skill-number">
                    04
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="skill-card">

                <div class="skill-icon">
                    🗄️
                </div>

                <div class="skill-info">

                    <h3>
                        Database
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Working with data, tables,
                        and basic database concepts.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="skill-number">
                    05
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="skill-card">

                <div class="skill-icon">
                    🌐
                </div>

                <div class="skill-info">

                    <h3>
                        Web Development
                    </h3>

                    <p>
                        Building and improving websites
                        through practical projects.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="skill-number">
                    06
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="skills-footer">

            <span></span>

            <p>
                Always learning. Always improving.
            </p>

            <span></span>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>

    </main>


    <footer>

        <p>
            © 2026 Froilyn Joy L. Mintal. All rights reserved.
